---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Returns, Repairs and Maintenance Policy | Kitchen And All" description="Return window, exchange, refund and repair terms for Kitchen And All customers in Kenya.">
  <section class="min-h-[60vh] bg-slate-50 px-4 py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl md:p-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-orange-600">Returns Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">Returns, exchanges, repairs and maintenance</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-500">This policy applies to customers in Kenya. It covers all products, including custom-fabricated and made-to-order items.</p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">14-day returns and exchanges</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We accept returns and exchanges on all products — including custom-fabricated and made-to-order items — for <strong>any reason, defective or non-defective</strong> (e.g. change of mind), within <strong>14 days</strong> of delivery or collection.</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Condition:</strong> the item must be unused and in new, resalable condition, with its original packaging where applicable.</li>
            <li><strong>Return method:</strong> returns are handled in store. Contact us first (details below) to arrange a time to bring the item to our Landhies Road workshop in Nairobi; we do not offer courier pickup for standard returns.</li>
            <li><strong>Restocking fee:</strong> non-defective returns (e.g. change of mind, wrong item ordered) are subject to a 40% restocking fee of the product price. There is no restocking fee if the item is defective or faulty due to our product or workmanship.</li>
            <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> once we've inspected the returned item in store, approved refunds are processed within 7 days.</li>
            <li><strong>Exchanges:</strong> if you'd prefer an exchange instead of a refund, let us know when you bring the item in and we'll arrange it, subject to stock availability.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">30-day installation fault cover</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For products we supply and install, this is in addition to the 14-day return window above: if a fault or installation issue appears within the first 30 days after installation, we'll inspect and repair it at no charge. If it can't be repaired and the fault is our responsibility, we'll arrange an exchange. If an item arrives damaged, incomplete, or different from the confirmed order, contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photographs where possible.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Costs outside the free windows</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Outside the 14-day return window and the 30-day installation fault cover, if an issue results from misuse, incorrect operation, negligence, accident, unauthorised modification, or normal wear and tear, the customer is responsible for the assessment, repair, and maintenance costs. We'll always provide an assessment and cost estimate before chargeable work begins.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Maintenance plans</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We offer monthly maintenance subscriptions for high-use or high-maintenance equipment that may need regular servicing. Contact us for a plan suited to your equipment and operating conditions.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">How to request a return, exchange, or repair</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Contact us before bringing anything in. Share your name, order details, delivery/installation date, a description of the issue or reason for return, and photographs or video where useful. We'll confirm whether it's covered and arrange a time for you to bring the item to our workshop.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="mailto:info@kitchenandall.co.ke">info@kitchenandall.co.ke</a> or message us on <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="https://wa.me/254741045143" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>